      "notes": "TODO after Pipedrive setup: label_ids [RFP|GRANT|FUNDING], custom fields Ecosystem / Source Link / Source API / Confidence / Item UID (hash keys from /v1/dealFields). Leads/Notes stay v1 — no v2 exists."
