      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Runs AFTER mark-done on purpose: the brief is an enhancement, never a delivery dependency. onError=continue — a KB outage must not fail the workflow. Ecosystems without an archived forum return {error} and the next IF skips the note."
    },
